[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_C08_PIN]
Brooch

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_C08_PIN_DESC]
A seemingly cheap souvenir from Saddle Arabia, this brooch is half of a fine natural gemstone that was originally part of a pair of pendants. It was redesigned into a brooch after being damaged.
The brooch is engraved with a cross star symbolizing powerful magic, similar to the cute mark of Starlight. Starlight wears this brooch on her chest in almost all public occasions, but few ponies notice it.

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_C08_PIN_o0_on]
Wear

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_C08_PIN_o0_off]
Unwear

[l_english.C02_C08_PIN_EQUIP_TOOLTIP]
Just as there are "Language of Flags", "Language of Flowers", and "Language of Gems" in the world, brooches also have their own language.
Pinning a brooch on the collar, cuff, chest, or hat can convey your different intentions to your friends.

[l_english.C08_PIN_SWITCH_ON_TOOLITP]
Starlight Glimmer is wearing the brooch.

